  "description": "Viewing on ***Sunday 11th Oct at 12.45***. Please contact me on email to book a place.\n\nA very large Penthouse apartment 2,000sq feet.  Three large double bedrooms, 2 bedrooms ensuite. Three bathrooms, three showers, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Eaton development in the heart of Rathcoole, County Dublin.\nRathcoole is an exceptionally rare find, making No. 38 Eaton close a truly unique opportunity. Extending to an impressive c. 200 sq.m, this stunning apartment is more than double the size of many properties within the Eaton development, offering an outstanding level of space that is seldom available in apartment living.\nPresented in superb condition throughout, the bright and spacious accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, an expansive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, three generous double bedrooms, two of which benefit from stylish ensuite bathrooms, a contemporary family bathroom. \nThe location is second to none. Situated in the heart of Rathcoole Village, every conceivable amenity is within walking distance, including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and local services. Excellent public transport links, including Dublin Bus, provide swift access to Dublin City Centre, while the nearby N7 and M50 make commuting even more convenient. A host of sporting and recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\nProperties of this calibre, size and location rarely come to the market. \n",
